- 76 pins on 5 servers, 0 quarantined; `tool_pins.last_checked` = 2026-10-01 19:39 for all 76.
- `pgboss.schedule` has `tool-pin-check 0 4 * * *` (UTC); `pgboss.job` holds ONE `tool-pin-check` row
