   200	/** The manifest with one tool's text put in — the locked-tool review's last step (his yes of 2026-10-04,
   201	 *  scripts/gateway/manifest-add.ts): a person read the locked text and the repository now vouches for it.
   202	 *  An entry for the same (server, tool) is REPLACED (the tool changed), else the tool is added and its
   203	 *  server counted. Refuses dxb-mcp (its authority is the source) and a text without an inputSchema. Pure:
   204	 *  the caller verifies and writes. */
   205	export function withTool(
